WEBVTT

01:41.190 --> 01:45.729
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.350 --> 01:50.770
[Episode 36]

02:14.190 --> 02:15.490
These days,

02:16.560 --> 02:17.820
it's been tough on you.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.590
Huaizhu.

02:24.390 --> 02:25.720
Can't humans and demons

02:26.910 --> 02:28.930
coexist peacefully?

02:31.770 --> 02:33.740
All that we've sacrificed...

02:36.240 --> 02:37.120
was it wrong?

02:44.000 --> 02:45.079
I hope

02:46.910 --> 02:48.630
the mask I love

02:51.030 --> 02:53.430
still remembers his original aspiration.

03:00.450 --> 03:01.250
Huaizhu.

03:04.050 --> 03:06.310
When you smiled in the past,

03:07.470 --> 03:09.320
your lips curled up like this.

03:09.240 --> 03:11.450
♪ The night breeze is gentle ♪

03:11.630 --> 03:13.120
And your eyes were curved

03:12.360 --> 03:15.000
♪ Rushing the sunset into dream ♪

03:15.080 --> 03:16.670
like crescent moons.

03:15.950 --> 03:18.470
♪ The fireflies fly in the night sky ♪

03:20.630 --> 03:21.980
Here...

03:20.910 --> 03:23.120
♪ The wine warms my throat ♪

03:23.710 --> 03:25.000
It was also relaxed.

03:23.740 --> 03:26.600
♪ The lake is wrinkled ♪

03:27.970 --> 03:30.770
♪ Waiting for you to dock by the riverside ♪

03:33.070 --> 03:35.950
♪ With appropriate makeup ♪

03:35.100 --> 03:36.010
Huaizhu.

03:38.260 --> 03:41.170
♪ Even gentler than the moon ♪

03:39.120 --> 03:39.960
I'm sorr—

03:43.220 --> 03:44.640
♪ Though I haven't gotten close to you ♪

03:45.180 --> 03:47.090
♪ My heart is already fluttering ♪

03:48.190 --> 03:52.870
♪ Just like a dream of midsummer ♪

03:55.860 --> 03:57.880
♪ In the forest ♪

03:58.470 --> 04:00.470
♪ Wine drops fall ♪

04:01.260 --> 04:03.510
♪ At the tip of my heart ♪

04:03.990 --> 04:05.920
♪ Face blushing ♪

04:06.750 --> 04:08.560
♪ Hands fiddling ♪

04:09.590 --> 04:11.260
♪ Clothes soaked wet ♪

04:11.900 --> 04:13.970
♪ The wine diminishing ♪

04:14.660 --> 04:16.100
♪ Love is getting deeper ♪

04:17.290 --> 04:19.510
♪ The full moon rises ♪

04:20.149 --> 04:21.940
♪ Our shadows overlap ♪

04:22.690 --> 04:24.770
♪ Worried that this scene ♪

04:25.550 --> 04:27.090
♪ Will pass too quickly ♪

04:28.270 --> 04:29.970
♪ If I'm granted a wish ♪

04:30.730 --> 04:32.720
♪ I don't wish for anything else ♪

04:33.760 --> 04:35.430
♪ I only hope that God ♪

04:36.460 --> 04:37.900
♪ Will bless ♪

04:37.650 --> 04:39.330
I hope this plan

04:39.470 --> 04:41.840
♪ This love ♪

04:40.020 --> 04:41.720
will allow us to use love

04:42.080 --> 04:43.490
to resolve everything.

04:43.230 --> 04:46.590
♪ To last longer ♪

05:04.380 --> 05:05.510
What's on your mind?

05:06.710 --> 05:07.970
Nothing much.

05:08.480 --> 05:09.480
Just spacing out.

05:10.890 --> 05:12.550
Then why don't you think about

05:13.310 --> 05:15.800
what our child will be like in the future?

05:18.370 --> 05:19.710
Our child...

05:22.120 --> 05:23.490
If it's a boy,

05:24.900 --> 05:26.360
he should be as kind as you.

05:28.620 --> 05:29.760
If it's a girl,

05:30.720 --> 05:32.720
she should be as intelligent as you.

05:33.670 --> 05:35.470
What will they inherit from you?

05:37.960 --> 05:40.159
It's better if they don't take after me.

05:41.570 --> 05:42.540
Why?

05:45.100 --> 05:48.430
I think our child will be like his father,

05:50.240 --> 05:53.040
banishing the Eternal Night and saving the world.

05:53.800 --> 05:55.650
It will become a great hero.

06:07.300 --> 06:09.110
Anyway, in eight months,

06:09.560 --> 06:10.730
you'll be a father.

06:17.520 --> 06:19.410
♪ Falling in love for the first time ♪

06:20.230 --> 06:22.010
♪ I miss you all the time ♪

06:22.920 --> 06:23.840
Be a father?

06:23.060 --> 06:24.680
♪ But I can't say anything ♪

06:25.650 --> 06:27.480
♪ To express it ♪

06:28.160 --> 06:29.550
♪ Frog and insect chirps ♪

06:30.590 --> 06:32.580
♪ Rapid and non-stopping ♪

06:33.970 --> 06:35.560
♪ The leaves rustle ♪

06:36.300 --> 06:38.730
♪ Like smashing bamboo ♪

06:38.680 --> 06:40.530
Our child...

06:40.300 --> 06:42.050
♪ In the whole universe ♪

06:42.760 --> 06:44.360
will become

06:43.480 --> 06:47.770
♪ All beings celebrate ♪

06:45.400 --> 06:47.400
the world's strongest swordsman.

07:13.790 --> 07:17.440
Since then, Hongye pulled himself together.

07:17.760 --> 07:20.250
There is finally hope in his heart,

07:21.160 --> 07:23.400
a hope that could carry everything.

07:24.050 --> 07:24.870
Master.

07:25.040 --> 07:26.470
W-What are you doing?

07:26.510 --> 07:28.290
I'm preparing the books, magical artifacts,

07:28.290 --> 07:30.330
and sword manuals for my child.

07:30.920 --> 07:32.110
But your wife

07:32.550 --> 07:34.280
isn't even three months along.

07:38.409 --> 07:39.310
Those books are

07:39.310 --> 07:40.920
moldy and infested with bugs.

07:40.920 --> 07:42.120
Get new copies made.

07:42.180 --> 07:44.050
Yes, I'll see to it right away.

07:44.740 --> 07:46.000
What do you need me for?

07:47.360 --> 07:50.570
This is the menu the kitchen prepared for your wife.

07:53.530 --> 07:55.960
[Pumpkin and red dates porridge
Mung bean soup with longans and lotus seeds
Freshly stewed duck soup]

07:53.820 --> 07:56.270
No fish. Huaizhu will get nauseated from the smell.

07:56.270 --> 07:58.840
Switch it to stir-fried Chinese mustard greens with bamboo shoots

07:58.840 --> 07:59.680
seasoned with vinegar.

07:59.680 --> 08:01.890
Okay, I'll instruct the kitchen right away.

08:01.890 --> 08:04.490
Also, Huaizhu has been vomiting a lot lately.

08:04.870 --> 08:06.730
She says her mouth tastes bitter.

08:07.160 --> 08:09.810
I remember when my wife was with child,

08:10.240 --> 08:11.390
she felt uncomfortable too.

08:11.390 --> 08:12.850
Why don't we have the kitchen

08:12.850 --> 08:15.710
prepare something sweet and sour to stimulate her appetite?

08:15.710 --> 08:17.140
Okay, get on with it then.

08:17.190 --> 08:17.720
Okay.

08:31.000 --> 08:31.870
There's more?

08:33.700 --> 08:35.450
So many snacks.

08:36.270 --> 08:38.750
Mr. Fei said you haven't had much of an appetite,

08:38.750 --> 08:39.880
so I prepared these.

08:39.970 --> 08:41.320
Maybe they'll help a bit.

08:41.320 --> 08:42.380
If you need anything,

08:42.380 --> 08:44.179
like things you want to eat or do,

08:44.320 --> 08:45.250
tell me anytime.

08:47.670 --> 08:51.260
There is something I really want to do.

08:51.750 --> 08:52.360
What is it?

08:53.110 --> 08:54.590
I was thinking our family

08:55.630 --> 08:58.230
could visit the Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai.

09:01.960 --> 09:02.630
Sure.

09:03.410 --> 09:04.780
On July 7th next year,

09:05.200 --> 09:07.150
we'll take our child along with us.

09:09.850 --> 09:12.090
How will we get there?

09:12.240 --> 09:13.240
Just like before.

09:13.720 --> 09:15.950
I'll ride my sword, and you'll ride your flute.

09:15.950 --> 09:17.180
Holding the child?

09:19.820 --> 09:22.030
I'll need to bring some spare clothes,

09:22.090 --> 09:23.750
so the baby doesn't pee on you.

09:28.630 --> 09:29.630
Nauseated again?

09:30.760 --> 09:32.090
I'll get you some water.

09:49.640 --> 09:50.720
Esteemed elders,

09:51.450 --> 09:53.680
the Yiqi Alliance has lost many talents,

09:53.680 --> 09:55.480
and the demon realm is in chaos.

09:56.160 --> 09:57.880
Regarding the current situation,

09:57.880 --> 09:59.740
I have a way to break the deadlock.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.680
How can we break it?

10:01.710 --> 10:04.530
If willing, the women of the Dongfang family

10:04.700 --> 10:07.700
can pass on their spiritual energy to their children.

10:07.820 --> 10:10.400
Then, using the Wangquan's unique secret technique,

10:10.400 --> 10:13.260
we can help awaken the child's innate sword spirit.

10:13.320 --> 10:15.080
This will allow the child

10:15.100 --> 10:18.330
to possess the talents of both great families.

10:19.180 --> 10:20.020
This is

10:20.910 --> 10:22.040
the Yiqi Alliance's

10:22.830 --> 10:23.500
warrior.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.360
You mean

10:26.610 --> 10:28.200
your child with Hongye

10:28.270 --> 10:29.870
will combine the Dongfang Spiritual Blood

10:29.870 --> 10:32.430
with the essence of the Wangquan swordsmanship

10:32.430 --> 10:35.090
to wield the most powerful Unparalleled Sword?

10:59.120 --> 10:59.970
Hongye.

11:00.410 --> 11:01.310
Get more rest.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.760
Did you stay up all night?

11:12.400 --> 11:14.460
I went out to attend to some business.

11:24.160 --> 11:25.010
Huaizhu.

11:27.360 --> 11:28.450
Can I...

11:30.640 --> 11:31.640
touch it?

11:34.440 --> 11:35.160
Of course.

11:53.410 --> 11:54.770
It's fine now.

12:05.610 --> 12:06.560
Hongye.

12:07.790 --> 12:09.290
The path you want to take

12:09.590 --> 12:11.110
has rarely been trodden.

12:11.920 --> 12:13.210
Feeling lost

12:14.030 --> 12:15.350
or uncertain

12:16.090 --> 12:17.370
are necessary stages.

12:18.280 --> 12:20.640
Your current struggle is because

12:21.670 --> 12:23.550
you don't want to give up, right?

12:29.520 --> 12:30.930
I don't want this world

12:32.390 --> 12:33.960
to stay like what it is now.

12:35.940 --> 12:37.520
I also don't want our child

12:38.860 --> 12:40.460
to be born into such a world.

12:44.120 --> 12:44.910
Then,

12:46.880 --> 12:48.480
for the sake of our family

12:49.480 --> 12:50.880
or for the world,

12:51.900 --> 12:55.110
go and do what you believe is right.

13:12.110 --> 13:13.770
Greetings, Master Wangquan.

13:13.870 --> 13:14.930
Greetings, Madam.

13:16.960 --> 13:18.620
It's been months since we met.

13:18.630 --> 13:21.000
Master, your hair's turned completely gray.

13:21.000 --> 13:23.330
It's tough at the Yiqi Alliance, isn't it?

13:24.260 --> 13:26.900
I think everyone is having a tough time.

13:28.650 --> 13:30.250
You still finally did it.

13:31.400 --> 13:32.970
But the price was too high.

13:35.730 --> 13:38.330
We have matters to discuss with Tushan.

13:43.360 --> 13:45.560
The Yiqi Alliance and the demon realm are in constant conflict,

13:45.560 --> 13:46.880
and it's worsening.

13:46.860 --> 13:51.830
[Human Realm] [Demon Realm]

13:46.930 --> 13:47.990
If this continues,

13:48.030 --> 13:50.230
the hatred in this world will only grow.

13:50.230 --> 13:51.990
We can't repeat the same mistakes.

13:51.990 --> 13:53.600
So the Yiqi Alliance and the demon realm

13:53.600 --> 13:55.540
should establish rules for peaceful coexistence,

13:55.540 --> 13:56.960
demarcate their respective territories,

13:56.960 --> 13:57.960
recuperate,

13:58.080 --> 13:59.340
and reduce conflicts.

13:59.870 --> 14:01.540
The demon realm is so vast.

14:01.770 --> 14:04.200
It's not something Tushan can decide on its own.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.100
The chaos in the demon realm

14:05.100 --> 14:06.180
is due to the lack of a leader,

14:06.180 --> 14:09.240
and only Tushan has the ability to lead the demon realm.

14:10.270 --> 14:11.240
But why should

14:11.260 --> 14:13.610
Tushan do such a thankless task?

14:14.050 --> 14:15.420
Isn't it better to live

14:15.440 --> 14:18.170
a carefree and happy life in Tushan's territory?

14:19.030 --> 14:20.710
I can guarantee on behalf of my sister

14:20.710 --> 14:23.630
that the Tushan fox demons will never invade the Yiqi Alliance,

14:23.630 --> 14:25.860
but beyond that, I'm afraid we can't do much.

14:25.860 --> 14:26.510
But—

14:26.550 --> 14:27.360
But what?

14:27.560 --> 14:30.160
With great power comes great responsibility?

14:30.360 --> 14:31.360
Master Wangquan.

14:31.790 --> 14:33.790
Where did your white hair come from?

14:34.120 --> 14:35.150
The responsibilities you've taken on

14:35.150 --> 14:36.600
and the sacrifices you've made,

14:36.600 --> 14:38.460
have they brought you happiness?

14:40.850 --> 14:42.180
Humans, unlike demons,

14:42.760 --> 14:44.750
have only a few decades to live.

14:44.870 --> 14:47.510
Shouldn't you cherish the present even more?

14:54.270 --> 14:57.800
Alright, the scenery in Tushan is beautiful lately.

14:58.000 --> 15:00.130
The Grief Tree is also being restored.

15:00.380 --> 15:02.930
Why don't you stay here with your wife

15:03.030 --> 15:04.760
and take some time off to relax?

15:07.920 --> 15:08.650
Thank you.

15:20.720 --> 15:22.790
This season is so pleasant.

15:23.600 --> 15:25.800
Yes, the scenery here is beautiful too.

15:26.950 --> 15:29.810
It seems you're not surprised by Tushan's refusal.

15:31.150 --> 15:33.080
When I didn't see Tushan Honghong,

15:33.390 --> 15:34.670
I expected it.

15:35.490 --> 15:36.870
Such a big matter

15:37.080 --> 15:38.720
can't be decided overnight.

15:39.510 --> 15:40.720
It takes time.

15:43.070 --> 15:43.830
Huaizhu.

15:45.670 --> 15:48.000
Tushan Yaya said something right.

15:49.010 --> 15:50.700
We all think life is long,

15:52.200 --> 15:53.800
and there's so much we can do.

15:54.190 --> 15:55.830
We always think we'll start

15:56.340 --> 15:57.770
when the time is right.

15:59.530 --> 16:01.190
But either we never get there,

16:01.440 --> 16:03.960
or while waiting and hoping,

16:05.390 --> 16:07.320
we miss the most important moment.

16:09.720 --> 16:10.670
And right now,

16:11.390 --> 16:13.960
with you and our child by my side,

16:14.630 --> 16:15.550
I'm very happy

16:16.790 --> 16:17.750
and content.

16:20.830 --> 16:21.780
So am I.

16:27.070 --> 16:29.740
Let's... go for a walk.

16:32.270 --> 16:35.120
I want to go see the Grief Tree.

16:35.500 --> 16:36.550
I'll go with you.

16:37.220 --> 16:38.880
Since we're rarely in Tushan,

16:39.330 --> 16:41.220
why don't you go check out the market?

16:41.220 --> 16:43.820
See if there's anything we can buy to take home.

16:47.400 --> 16:48.210
Don't worry.

16:53.050 --> 16:53.640
Alright.

16:54.330 --> 16:56.580
I'll meet you at the Grief Tree later.

17:19.329 --> 17:20.990
It's changed a lot, hasn't it?

17:23.790 --> 17:24.510
Yes.

17:26.510 --> 17:27.680
It has changed a lot.

17:29.030 --> 17:31.830
It's the season of falling flowers.

17:34.590 --> 17:35.790
Different seasons

17:36.530 --> 17:37.970
have their own beauty.

17:53.290 --> 17:55.690
Your foundation's been severely damaged.

17:55.830 --> 17:58.090
Do you know you don't have much time left?

18:00.000 --> 18:01.000
Even so, you still

18:01.400 --> 18:02.830
want to use the Dongfang Spiritual Blood

18:02.830 --> 18:04.030
to conceive a child?

18:05.830 --> 18:07.360
This breach of the Boundary

18:07.510 --> 18:10.640
has destroyed all the young elites of the Yiqi Alliance.

18:11.350 --> 18:13.280
Although the Black Fox was killed,

18:14.060 --> 18:15.660
you sent a message telling me

18:16.550 --> 18:18.750
that the Black Grief Tree still exists.

18:19.370 --> 18:22.410
That means the Black Fox will still return.

18:24.030 --> 18:27.510
A child born from the union of the Dongfang and Wangquan families

18:27.510 --> 18:29.970
will possess the strongest innate talents.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.110
It...

18:33.880 --> 18:35.940
will be the hope to kill the Black Fox.

18:37.070 --> 18:38.160
Is that all?

18:39.790 --> 18:40.990
What matters most...

18:49.310 --> 18:50.640
Of course, it's Hongye.

18:52.290 --> 18:54.360
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

18:54.920 --> 18:57.380
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

18:57.990 --> 19:01.710
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

19:02.860 --> 19:07.240
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

19:05.050 --> 19:06.380
In the mortal world,

19:08.170 --> 19:12.210
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

19:08.540 --> 19:10.870
each meeting means lesser time together.

19:13.300 --> 19:15.300
♪ We're fully committed ♪

19:14.750 --> 19:15.830
I'm envious too...

19:15.840 --> 19:17.640
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

19:18.660 --> 19:22.390
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

19:19.710 --> 19:23.040
that humans and demons can renew their fate in the next life.

19:23.240 --> 19:25.460
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

19:25.440 --> 19:26.750
But Hongye and I

19:25.950 --> 19:28.330
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

19:29.360 --> 19:33.670
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

19:30.430 --> 19:32.280
seem to have used up all our luck

19:34.080 --> 19:36.000
just to meet each other.

19:35.510 --> 19:39.950
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

19:40.030 --> 19:42.170
Every person he cherishes

19:40.590 --> 19:43.190
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

19:43.370 --> 19:45.330
leaves him one by one.

19:43.610 --> 19:45.600
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

19:46.340 --> 19:48.300
♪ Time goes by ♪

19:47.440 --> 19:48.410
Now,

19:48.840 --> 19:50.820
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

19:50.130 --> 19:51.130
even I...

19:51.560 --> 19:54.990
♪ But our love remains still ♪

19:56.520 --> 20:00.900
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

19:56.590 --> 19:57.720
I don't understand.

19:59.650 --> 20:02.030
He has sacrificed so much for the world.

20:01.800 --> 20:04.360
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

20:02.850 --> 20:05.070
Why does the heavens treat him like this?

20:05.070 --> 20:06.970
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

20:07.500 --> 20:09.170
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

20:09.910 --> 20:11.720
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

20:09.920 --> 20:10.830
So, please...

20:12.350 --> 20:15.940
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

20:14.040 --> 20:15.040
my dear child,

20:16.270 --> 20:17.070
accompany him

20:18.860 --> 20:20.100
on my behalf.

20:25.070 --> 20:25.900
Huaizhu!

20:37.750 --> 20:39.650
♪ We're fully committed ♪

20:38.510 --> 20:40.000
We don't have much time,

20:40.290 --> 20:42.190
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

20:42.400 --> 20:44.310
but I'll love him infinitely

20:43.110 --> 20:47.000
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

20:46.070 --> 20:47.520
within the finite time.

20:47.460 --> 20:49.940
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

20:50.520 --> 20:52.690
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

20:53.550 --> 20:55.510
I made this. Do you like it?

20:53.670 --> 20:57.990
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

20:58.240 --> 20:58.960
Yes.

20:59.960 --> 21:04.400
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

21:02.110 --> 21:03.030
You're crying.

21:05.040 --> 21:07.460
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

21:05.510 --> 21:06.680
It's the sandstorm.

21:07.540 --> 21:08.490
It's gotten into my eyes.

21:08.060 --> 21:10.020
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

21:10.410 --> 21:11.490
Put it on me.

21:10.790 --> 21:12.740
♪ Time goes by ♪

21:13.380 --> 21:14.100
Okay.

21:13.500 --> 21:15.340
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

21:16.010 --> 21:19.390
♪ But our love remains still ♪

21:20.170 --> 21:20.970
Beautiful.

21:20.970 --> 21:25.350
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

21:23.000 --> 21:24.160
Let's go home.

21:26.090 --> 21:28.640
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

21:29.180 --> 21:31.190
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

21:31.650 --> 21:33.570
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

21:33.110 --> 21:33.750
Let's go.

21:34.100 --> 21:36.020
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

21:36.610 --> 21:40.050
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

21:42.200 --> 21:43.660
Human emotions

21:44.050 --> 21:45.960
are hard to explain or describe,

21:46.600 --> 21:48.620
but you can feel the happiness

21:49.060 --> 21:51.030
between those who love each other.

21:51.510 --> 21:54.720
A happiness that brings joy even to bystanders.

21:54.920 --> 21:55.680
And I

21:56.270 --> 21:58.030
also felt it for the first time.

21:59.110 --> 21:59.830
Perhaps

22:00.180 --> 22:03.770
love can really transcend life and death.

22:07.330 --> 22:10.050
With the joint efforts of Tushan and Hongye,

22:10.280 --> 22:12.800
humans and demons finally drew boundaries.

22:13.100 --> 22:16.550
The demon realm has abundant resources, with no need for further war.

22:14.280 --> 22:18.200
[Human Realm] [Demon Realm]

22:17.200 --> 22:20.640
The war has ceased, and temporary peace has been achieved.

22:30.750 --> 22:31.640
Huaizhu.

22:32.370 --> 22:33.430
I’ve decided.

22:34.960 --> 22:36.490
Let's name our child Fugui,

22:36.580 --> 22:37.780
which means fortune.

22:39.270 --> 22:40.900
I chose it from our family tree.

22:40.900 --> 22:42.160
It's gender-neutral.

22:43.970 --> 22:44.740
I don't care.

22:45.310 --> 22:46.580
It's fine for a boy,

22:46.600 --> 22:48.660
but we cannot use this name for a girl.

22:48.910 --> 22:49.700
Why?

22:52.340 --> 22:53.850
No means no.

22:55.950 --> 22:57.550
Then what name do you prefer?

23:04.710 --> 23:05.970
From now on, this sword

23:05.990 --> 23:07.990
will be our child's Wangquan Sword.

23:08.310 --> 23:10.310
I'll teach all the sword techniques

23:10.330 --> 23:11.090
to him.

23:24.570 --> 23:25.820
During this time,

23:26.320 --> 23:27.990
we've both been very happy.

23:29.240 --> 23:32.510
So happy that it feels like we've returned to those days.

23:34.510 --> 23:38.180
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

23:34.930 --> 23:36.860
The sheath and flute intertwined,

23:37.510 --> 23:40.880
together we longed for eternity.

24:07.270 --> 24:09.110
It's born. It's born!

24:13.960 --> 24:15.030
Congratulations, Master.

24:15.030 --> 24:16.200
She has given birth to a boy.

24:16.200 --> 24:17.030
How is my wife?

24:17.270 --> 24:18.000
She...

24:18.640 --> 24:19.660
She...

24:21.110 --> 24:21.640
She...

24:21.640 --> 24:22.300
Move aside!

24:23.720 --> 24:24.630
Huaizhu.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.260
Why?

24:30.550 --> 24:32.790
Why did she cough up blood from giving birth?

24:32.790 --> 24:34.740
Master, I don't know either.

24:34.790 --> 24:37.030
After giving birth to the boy,

24:37.070 --> 24:39.990
she started coughing up blood and fainted.

24:40.590 --> 24:41.430
Huaizhu.

24:42.170 --> 24:42.930
Huaizhu.

24:53.750 --> 24:54.510
Huaizhu.

25:00.790 --> 25:01.550
Huaizhu.

25:02.910 --> 25:03.710
Huaizhu.

25:05.920 --> 25:06.590
Huaizhu.

25:07.630 --> 25:09.250
What's happening to you?

25:17.030 --> 25:18.410
I'm sorry.

25:20.270 --> 25:21.730
That day...

25:23.290 --> 25:25.070
when I ambushed Jin Renfeng,

25:26.340 --> 25:27.990
he attacked me.

25:29.670 --> 25:30.810
I think

25:31.180 --> 25:33.120
he did it on purpose,

25:34.980 --> 25:37.850
intending to end the Dongfang bloodline.

25:38.640 --> 25:40.070
Since then,

25:41.550 --> 25:42.920
my lifespan has been...

25:45.000 --> 25:46.590
greatly shortened.

25:49.740 --> 25:53.540
I've been taking tonics,

25:57.030 --> 25:58.690
always hoping...

26:00.730 --> 26:02.090
to spend more time

26:03.620 --> 26:06.370
with you and our child.

26:09.340 --> 26:10.730
But now it seems...

26:13.750 --> 26:15.640
it's impossible.

26:16.460 --> 26:17.500
Why?

26:19.400 --> 26:20.590
Why didn't you...

26:21.600 --> 26:23.730
tell me earlier?

26:31.400 --> 26:32.590
Our child...

26:33.240 --> 26:34.110
Our child...

26:36.160 --> 26:37.350
Let me...

26:57.110 --> 26:58.240
This is wonderful.

27:04.130 --> 27:05.200
Hongye.

27:08.880 --> 27:09.550
I...

27:11.030 --> 27:13.000
I have one last wish.

27:28.190 --> 27:32.690
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

27:34.920 --> 27:35.960
Please go.

27:37.790 --> 27:39.030
Don't come in.

28:15.270 --> 28:16.880
Finding a soulmate in life

28:17.830 --> 28:19.200
is rare and precious.

28:21.870 --> 28:22.870
Try it on.

28:54.790 --> 28:55.940
At least...

28:58.700 --> 29:01.260
the heavens allowed me to meet you.

29:02.650 --> 29:04.620
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

29:05.280 --> 29:07.740
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

29:08.350 --> 29:12.070
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

29:13.220 --> 29:17.600
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

29:18.330 --> 29:20.320
I want to make three rules with you, Miss.

29:18.530 --> 29:22.570
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

29:20.380 --> 29:22.460
First, you must not intervene.

29:23.660 --> 29:25.660
♪ We're fully committed ♪

29:26.200 --> 29:28.110
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

29:26.220 --> 29:28.820
Second, you must stay within ten steps from me.

29:29.020 --> 29:32.750
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

29:33.600 --> 29:35.820
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

29:36.310 --> 29:38.690
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

29:36.550 --> 29:37.340
Third,

29:37.890 --> 29:39.370
hold onto my scabbard

29:39.480 --> 29:40.800
and never let go.

29:39.720 --> 29:44.030
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

29:44.510 --> 29:45.840
Young Master Wangquan.

29:45.870 --> 29:50.310
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

29:46.320 --> 29:47.850
Let's part ways here.

29:48.000 --> 29:49.460
I hope we never meet again.

29:50.950 --> 29:53.550
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

29:53.970 --> 29:55.960
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

29:56.700 --> 29:58.660
♪ Time goes by ♪

29:59.200 --> 30:01.180
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

30:01.920 --> 30:05.350
♪ But our love remains still ♪

30:06.880 --> 30:11.260
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

30:08.440 --> 30:09.680
How could you

30:10.700 --> 30:12.820
go to such great lengths to save me?

30:12.160 --> 30:14.720
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

30:12.880 --> 30:14.740
I haven't thought about all that.

30:14.790 --> 30:15.920
What have you thought about?

30:15.430 --> 30:17.330
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

30:16.420 --> 30:17.750
That I mustn't lose you.

30:17.860 --> 30:19.530
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

30:20.270 --> 30:22.080
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

30:22.710 --> 30:26.300
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

30:40.420 --> 30:41.950
I'll wait for you to return.

30:43.770 --> 30:47.230
There's still so much I want to do with you.

30:47.810 --> 30:48.860
Wait for me to return.

30:48.110 --> 30:50.010
♪ We're fully committed ♪

30:50.650 --> 30:52.550
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

30:53.470 --> 30:57.360
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

30:57.820 --> 31:00.300
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

31:00.880 --> 31:03.050
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

31:04.030 --> 31:08.350
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

31:10.320 --> 31:14.760
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

31:15.400 --> 31:17.820
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

31:18.420 --> 31:20.380
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

31:21.150 --> 31:23.100
♪ Time goes by ♪

31:23.740 --> 31:25.070
Finally...

31:23.860 --> 31:25.700
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

31:26.370 --> 31:29.750
♪ But our love remains still ♪

31:27.750 --> 31:29.790
Promise me one thing.

31:31.330 --> 31:35.710
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

31:31.510 --> 31:33.310
The Yiqi Alliance warrior

31:33.850 --> 31:35.600
is my plan.

31:36.450 --> 31:39.000
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

31:36.620 --> 31:37.470
But

31:39.070 --> 31:40.510
if one day,

31:39.540 --> 31:41.550
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

31:41.950 --> 31:43.760
our child wants to leave...

31:42.010 --> 31:43.930
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

31:44.460 --> 31:46.380
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

31:46.970 --> 31:50.410
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

31:48.700 --> 31:50.460
Please let him go.

31:54.900 --> 31:55.970
Also,

31:57.180 --> 31:59.720
never give up

32:01.440 --> 32:03.590
on finding your sword heart.

32:06.820 --> 32:08.030
Because

32:10.110 --> 32:11.920
the man I love...

32:13.640 --> 32:17.550
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

32:14.520 --> 32:16.760
has always been

32:17.790 --> 32:19.030
a legendary...

32:18.990 --> 32:21.320
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

32:21.890 --> 32:23.900
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

32:22.830 --> 32:26.070
hero.

32:24.560 --> 32:26.660
♪ Time goes by ♪

32:27.210 --> 32:29.190
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

32:29.870 --> 32:33.510
♪ But our love remains still ♪

32:34.990 --> 32:39.240
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

32:39.700 --> 32:42.200
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

32:42.370 --> 32:45.390
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

32:42.820 --> 32:44.920
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

32:45.400 --> 32:47.350
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

32:47.930 --> 32:49.870
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

32:50.430 --> 32:53.610
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

32:57.230 --> 32:58.430
I can't recite poetry

32:58.450 --> 32:59.440
or sing.

32:59.510 --> 33:01.000
I'm not skilled in the four arts.

33:01.000 --> 33:03.240
Nor can I cook, do laundry, or make beds.

33:05.010 --> 33:08.020
The only thing I'm good at is fighting and magic duels.

33:08.140 --> 33:09.250
So, are you

33:09.890 --> 33:10.880
disappointed?

33:17.140 --> 33:21.160
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

33:22.420 --> 33:24.620
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

33:25.290 --> 33:27.400
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

33:28.120 --> 33:29.790
♪ The past vanishes ♪

33:30.320 --> 33:32.020
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

33:32.780 --> 33:36.680
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

33:42.980 --> 33:52.760
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

33:56.960 --> 34:00.940
[Tomb of beloved wife Dongfang Huaizhu]

34:35.780 --> 34:41.330
[Tomb of beloved wife Dongfang Huaizhu]

35:10.630 --> 35:12.340
[Tomb of beloved wife Dongfang Huaizhu]

35:12.550 --> 35:14.510
Mommy, I've come to see you.

35:12.590 --> 35:14.520
[Wangquan Fugui, son of Wangquan Hongye, Yiqi Alliance]

35:14.750 --> 35:18.160
[Tomb of Beloved Wife Dongfang Huaizhu]

35:31.230 --> 35:31.880
Let's go.

35:32.980 --> 35:34.380
Time for sword practice.

35:48.510 --> 35:49.970
Since then,

35:50.690 --> 35:54.590
all the families of the Yiqi Alliance began to conserve their strength,

35:54.590 --> 35:57.840
focusing on cultivation and educating talents,

35:58.370 --> 36:01.300
aiming to accumulate strength before making a move.

36:19.170 --> 36:21.360
[Zhang Qi, the first disciple of the Zhangs, Yiqi Alliance]

36:42.830 --> 36:45.290
[Deng Jiuru, the Dengs of Yiqi Alliance]

36:45.400 --> 36:47.510
Greetings, new master!

36:49.080 --> 36:50.750
These transformations

36:51.170 --> 36:55.030
will become the future strength of the Yiqi Alliance.

36:57.760 --> 36:59.230
Wangquan Hongye also

36:57.930 --> 37:01.930
[Unparalleled Hall]

36:59.360 --> 37:02.290
single-handedly revitalized the Wangquan family,

37:03.160 --> 37:05.490
leading the then-weakened Yiqi Alliance

37:05.520 --> 37:06.930
to regain its glory,

37:06.120 --> 37:11.380
[Wangquan Manor]

37:07.840 --> 37:12.280
re-establishing order between the human and demon realms.

37:26.500 --> 37:29.360
[Wangquan]

37:32.820 --> 37:36.240
[Wangquan Manor]

38:12.710 --> 38:14.710
[Unparalleled Hall]

38:14.790 --> 38:17.460
[Unparalleled Sword]

38:22.480 --> 38:25.330
Greetings, Young Master Wangquan!

38:26.030 --> 38:28.400
[Unparalleled Sword]

38:39.160 --> 38:45.620
[Unparalleled Sword]
